                    "activity": "U.S. military wives’ death threats\nFive military wives received death threats from a hacker group calling itself “CyberCaliphate”, claiming to be an Islamic State affiliate, on February 10, 2015. This was later discovered to have been a false flag attack by {{Sofacy, APT 28, Fancy Bear, Sednit}}, when the victims’ email addresses were found to have been in the Fancy Bear phishing target list.\nhttps://www.apnews.com/4d174e45ef5843a0ba82e804f080988f"
